### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Data Read (4)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve specific trading view data by its ID.
- `GET /api/v1/offers` — Get a list of available trading offers.
- `GET /enum/ordered` — Fetch an ordered enumeration of values.
- `GET /public/news-flow/v2/news` — Retrieve news flow data from TradingView.

### Media (2)
- `GET /static/bundles/{bundleJwt}` — Download a static bundle file using a JWT.
- `GET /static/images/favicon/manifest.json` — Download the favicon manifest file.

